[select]
<h2>                   ~[Irainvortex.28]               <br>
~m                          Level Select                    </h2>
<p>Welcome.  From here you can play any mission you were able to reach, as well as see the missions you have not yet reached.<br>
<p>The ~lforward~w button advances the timeline from a branching point.
The ~rreverse~w button brings the timeline back the to the last branch.<br>
The ~ichange~w button changes the outcome of the branching mission.  
